  093f2e2cfd2a63a8bb495760a8ce83a847635355fd0093fa506bc02d6a6995f5

Upstream project: https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0
Local modifications: removed the TVM/JIT wrapper (which is what dragged in the
C++20 <concepts> headers that crash the PPU SDK 2.1.0 clang), retained the PPU
device algorithm unchanged, pinned the template parameters to the measured arm
(kBlockN=256, kStages=2, kSwizzle=true), and exposed an RTP-LLM AOT launcher
using the caller's current stream.
